<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Linens 'n Things started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Linens 'n Things started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said on Wednesday analyst Aram Rubinson had started coverage of Linens 'n Things Inc with a rating of attractive.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were up 3/4 to 25.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
